          "description": "The Old Mrs. Moody Show follows Old Mrs. Moody and her friend Catbaloo, whose ordinary days together sometimes lead to unexpected adventures and often remind Catbaloo of a story she’d like to tell. And as her story begins, listeners enter a world so rich with music and sound that the story itself comes to life all around them—and as it ends, they leave with a sense of warmth and goodness.",
